---

---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-20 pt-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-realtime>
  <div class="text-center">
    <div class="mb-6 inline-block rounded-full bg-[#1a2541] px-4 py-2" data-motion="fade-up">
      <span class="text-sm font-medium text-indigo-400">公平至上的Minecraft体验</span>
    </div>

    <h1
      class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl"
      data-motion="fade-up"
      style="--motion-delay: 100ms"
    >
      <span class="text-white">下一代 </span><span class="gradient-text font-bold font-sans">公益服务器</span>
    </h1>

    <div
      class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg text-gray-300 sm:text-xl"
      data-motion="fade-up"
      style="--motion-delay: 200ms"
    >
      <p>由开发者NekoSora和CYAN-HEX创建</p>
      <p>继承VBPIXEL和EternalStar精神的公益小游戏服务器</p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center"
      data-motion="fade-up"
      style="--motion-delay: 300ms"
    >
      <div
        class="flex min-h-[140px] w-full max-w-xs flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-gray-700 bg-[#1a1f2e]/50 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm"
      >
        <div>
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500" data-minigame-hero-dot></div>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-300">MINIGAME</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-2 font-mono text-lg font-bold">minigame.voidix.net</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-end justify-between">
          <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-300">兼容 26.1-26.1.2</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-400" data-minigame-status>0 在线</div>
            <div class="relative inline-block" hidden data-minigame-status-note>
              <div class="group relative inline-block">
                <div
                  class="flex h-4 w-4 cursor-help items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-yellow-500/40 bg-yellow-500/20 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-yellow-500/60 hover:bg-yellow-500/30"
                >
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold text-yellow-400">?</span>
                </div>
                <div
                  class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-full left-1/2 z-10 mb-2 w-max max-w-[200px] -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-normal rounded-lg border border-gray-600 bg-gray-800/90 px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs text-gray-200 opacity-0 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-200 group-hover:pointer-events-auto group-hover:opacity-100"
                >
                  实时状态查询服务仅在中国大陆网络提供
                  <div
                    class="absolute left-1/2 top-full -translate-x-1/2 border-4 border-transparent border-t-gray-800/90"
                  >
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="flex min-h-[140px] w-full max-w-xs flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-gray-700 bg-[#1a1f2e]/50 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm"
      >
        <div>
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="h-3 w-3 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></div>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-300">SURVIVAL</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-2 font-mono text-lg font-bold">survival.voidix.net</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-end justify-between">
          <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-300">兼容 1.7.2-最新</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-yellow-400">
            <div>状态系统维护</div>
            <div class="relative inline-block">
              <div class="group relative inline-block">
                <div
                  class="flex h-4 w-4 cursor-help items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-yellow-500/40 bg-yellow-500/20 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-yellow-500/60 hover:bg-yellow-500/30"
                >
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold text-yellow-400">?</span>
                </div>
                <div
                  class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-full left-1/2 z-10 mb-2 w-max max-w-[200px] -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-normal rounded-lg border border-gray-600 bg-gray-800/90 px-3 py-2 text-left text-xs text-gray-200 opacity-0 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-200 group-hover:pointer-events-auto group-hover:opacity-100"
                >
                  生存服状态查询系统当前正在维护，建议您进入游戏检查生存服状态
                  <div
                    class="absolute left-1/2 top-full -translate-x-1/2 border-4 border-transparent border-t-gray-800/90"
                  >
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center" data-motion="fade-up" style="--motion-delay: 400ms">
      <a href="https://geysermc.org/wiki/geyser/">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-gray-700 bg-[#1a1f2e]/50 px-4 py-2">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true">
            <path
              clip-rule="evenodd"
              d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 1 1 1.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0Z"
              fill-rule="evenodd"></path>
          </svg>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium">基岩版玩家兼容性</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-20 flex justify-center" data-motion="fade" style="--motion-delay: 500ms">
    <div class="relative h-64 w-full max-w-4xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#2a365c] sm:h-80 md:h-96">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900/20 to-indigo-900/20"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="p-8 text-center">
          <div class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">探索无限可能的世界</div>
          <p class="mx-auto mb-6 max-w-lg text-gray-300">完全公平的游戏环境，无付费优势，只有纯粹的Minecraft乐趣</p>
          <div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
            <a
              href="/status/"
              class="inline-flex max-w-36 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-blue-700"
              >查看服务器状态</a
            >
            <a
              href="/faq/"
              class="inline-flex max-w-36 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-gray-700"
              >常见问题解答</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
